 | Fasteners | Four M2 × 4 mm screws through the PCB into the integral base posts |

 The STEP assembly includes the substrate, a sensor package, a shield and six contact pads. Their positions define a reference board envelope for the enclosure. An electrical design, fabrication files and measured thermal or airflow performance would require a separate board design and prototype.
+
+## Bench plate interface BM-64
+
+The removable lid stays inside the original 52 × 36 mm footprint. Two integral 3.2 mm-thick external ears fasten the base to a mating bench plate. The drawing specifies two vertical Ø3.40 mm through holes centered on X = −32.00 mm and +32.00 mm at Y = 0.00 mm, a 64.00 mm pitch. The XY origin remains the center of the enclosure and Z = 0 is the bench contact face.
+
+The Bench BOM includes two externally supplied M3 fasteners. Select their length against the actual plate thickness or tapped depth. The plate and its fasteners are external installation hardware. Sample-print the interface and test screw access, clamp load, print strength and retention before installation.
